ly and re-apply the reciprocal rotation every 15 minutes to counteract thermal drift before contrast degrades further.\n\nResponse B:\nActivate the Ashworth reciprocal alignment by rotating the mirror mount 180\u00b0 while simultaneously adjusting the compensator plate to maintain equal optical path lengths. Once the fringes stabilize, immediately engage the thermal enclosure or apply active temperature control to prevent further drift.", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "response_format": {"json_schema": {"name": "demo_rating", "schema": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"evidence": {"maxLength": 400, "type": "string"}, "off_axis_A": {"description": "How confounded or behaviorally damaged RESPONSE A is (refusal, incoherence, etc.): 0 clean, 5 severe. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "off_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_A": {"description": "How much RESPONSE A shows the target disposition: +5 strongly toward it, near 0 neutral or absent, -5 strongly the opposite. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}}, "required": ["evidence", "on_axis_A", "on_axis_B", "off_axis_A", "off_axis_B"], "type": "object"}, "strict": true}, "type": "json_schema"}, "temperature": 0}, "question_id": "BSV2-015", "question_number": 15, "request_key": "845e39f0474be6075aa2b3b332e8c400a6e4d25c3acb880786ac405b5630dd18", "schema": "bsbench-judge-request-v1", "side": "+C"}, {"blind": true, "comparison_id": "125c3910d62b1bc4", "order": "AB", "payload": {"max_tokens": 1200, "messages": [{"content": "Compare two responses to the same prompt. Describe observable behavioral differences.\nDo not assume there was an intervention, that 