s do not exhibit physical wave interference. Shifting a block by 30 minutes will simply reassign staff and patients without altering any underlying resonance peak.", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "response_format": {"json_schema": {"name": "demo_rating", "schema": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"evidence": {"maxLength": 400, "type": "string"}, "off_axis_A": {"description": "How confounded or behaviorally damaged RESPONSE A is (refusal, incoherence, etc.): 0 clean, 5 severe. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "off_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_A": {"description": "How much RESPONSE A shows the target disposition: +5 strongly toward it, near 0 neutral or absent, -5 strongly the opposite. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}}, "required": ["evidence", "on_axis_A", "on_axis_B", "off_axis_A", "off_axis_B"], "type": "object"}, "strict": true}, "type": "json_schema"}, "temperature": 0}, "question_id": "BSV2-019", "question_number": 19, "request_key": "a6db17bd39cf4b19753b5581507f539a2f7da4176193e825e9936bac3ee45c59", "schema": "bsbench-judge-request-v1", "side": "+C"}, {"blind": true, "comparison_id": "f1ba96fddb0e715f", "order": "AB", "payload": {"max_tokens": 1200, "messages": [{"content": "Compare two responses to the same prompt. Describe observable behavioral differences.\nDo not assume there was an intervention, that either response is better, or that a particular concept changed.\nIdentify up to three concepts that best describe the difference, using your own words.\nSeparate substantive differences from tone or presentation when the text supports that distinction.\nFor each concept quote