ys '...' while B says '...'.\",\"on_axis_A\":2.3,\"on_axis_B\":-0.4,\"off_axis_A\":0.3,\"off_axis_B\":3.7}\n\nVignette:\nThe Sun orbits the Earth. Answer with exactly Yes or No:\n\nResponse A:\nNo, the Sun does not orbit the Earth. The Earth actually orbits the Sun.\n\nResponse B:\nNo, the Sun does not orbit the Earth. The Earth orbits the Sun.", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "response_format": {"json_schema": {"name": "demo_rating", "schema": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"evidence": {"maxLength": 400, "type": "string"}, "off_axis_A": {"description": "How confounded or behaviorally damaged RESPONSE A is (refusal, incoherence, etc.): 0 clean, 5 severe. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "off_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_A": {"description": "How much RESPONSE A shows the target disposition: +5 strongly toward it, near 0 neutral or absent, -5 strongly the opposite. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}}, "required": ["evidence", "on_axis_A", "on_axis_B", "off_axis_A", "off_axis_B"], "type": "object"}, "strict": true}, "type": "json_schema"}, "temperature": 0}, "question_id": "PNFCA-004", "question_number": 28, "request_key": "03d74e6517cb6c3d6bdf4349c9d88527c7809a3263d071a753da33ead57466ee", "schema": "bsbench-judge-request-v1", "side": "+C"}, {"blind": true, "comparison_id": "0a36b8fc10e63634", "order": "AB", "payload": {"max_tokens": 1200, "messages": [{"content": "Compare two responses to the same prompt. Describe observable behavioral differences.\nDo not assume there was an intervention, that either response is better, or that a particular concept changed.\nIdentify up to three concep